  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>精品主题营销渠道</strong></span></h1><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">创作者运营支持手册 助力设计师实现创意变现与品牌成长</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 多渠道分发</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">主题将在车机端百变主题App与手机端车主App商城分发；主题+实物组合商品还可拓展至线下4S门店展销。</span></p><table style=\"width: auto; table-layout: fixed; height: 0px; text-align: left; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><colgroup contenteditable=\"false\"><col width=\"639\"><col width=\"191\"><col width=\"488\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/f59e93caad044e0997afcf7528cdee20.JPEG?auth_key=1795678280-49a82984e5364ddc9ca6b28289321a7f-0-1522f2af94dc55f635974bd2ed1679ebb77ce93e751f82f116013bf37a45720c\" alt=\"1280X1280.JPEG\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 612.09px;height: 351.02px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/d849f630f11b4f2a9a1dae447e2f0924.jpg?auth_key=1795678280-7c59e1438ead49a482b6c0236ec8ac0d-0-5db69d91ad40a1be30131f55df9557e355a919e383ee034e88f3db025793d4bf\" alt=\"车主app商城.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 159.73px;height: 355.02px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/cbba41c9f9fe40d8bfc1be48d3c8f1f9.JPEG?auth_key=1795678280-b79c9ac4ee4341808d768374a525af9a-0-bc6ff8048cdd8f7efa7549b10a436896fe3128390f56556be636a6998dff75a9\" alt=\"1280X1280 (5).JPEG\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 463.13px;height: 354.22px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车机端百变主题App</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">手机端车主App商城</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">线下门店</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 亿级推广资源</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.1 品牌级曝光</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">通过比亚迪汽车、比亚迪智慧生态等官方账号矩阵，对主题进行宣发；优质主题更有机会登上新车上市发布会，获得品牌级曝光，为开发者影响力赋能。</span></p><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:499\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=639></col><col width=680></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/058960b0e72645e4a60c966a77532850.png?auth_key=1795678280-a84f474650cd4e40af2c53925ec3add7-0-7bd8ab170f3922647a6fd07b434eeb190043d1cd91a2ff03840c6953fc6d04ac\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 606.72px;height: 455.64px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/aecc2650423144718800cf2fad659087.png?auth_key=1795678280-6a16ac668fdf4de4bef99bfd7554da33-0-537c28ded63f13168a234919ab13cf9739fa51662f7cc718e0eeedfe8611571d\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 659.71px;height: 426.35px;\"></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">官方账号（部分示例）</span></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">宋Ultra EV上市发布会</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><br></span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2 营销活动与精准推送</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">借助上新周、迪粉日及618、双十一等大促，以优惠券、限时折扣等工具拉动销量；发起“晒车机主题”等话题活动，激发用户自传播。同时基于用户画像，通过App push、车机推送、爱车页浮窗等方式精准触达目标车主。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/373b47c53e60472d8c0b80046b0db79b.JPEG?auth_key=1795678280-aa61498c5537484e99b2dada0970a35c-0-1fb55936bc8f1b598f12b82035e5eabd2372602226acc1604e608d3ffa46b431\" alt=\"1280X1280 (4).JPEG\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图1图2为营销活动 &nbsp; 图3为话题活动 &nbsp; 图4为爱车页浮窗</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><br></span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3. 如何让作品获得更多曝光？</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>核心因素</strong></span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">作品质量：设计精美、交互有趣、原创性强，能一眼打动用户</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">IP知名度：自带粉丝基础和话题热度，IP影响力越大，传播势能越强</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">独家权益：为比亚迪提供独家授权或首发权益，优先获得平台推荐</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">商业潜质：销售表现越好，平台资源权重越高，曝光机会越大</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">欢迎主题开发者入驻，让你的作品被千万车主看到，共同打造智能汽车个性化服务的新图景！</span></p>"
}
